{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/cc9b51a808e9192f05a007c2b169dc4d.avif?t=1773812900\" width=1560 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/527e8db495fa26a9260b10d64bd9466e.poster.avif?t=1773812900\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/527e8db495fa26a9260b10d64bd9466e.webm?t=1773812900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/527e8db495fa26a9260b10d64bd9466e.mp4?t=1773812900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A ROGUELIKE CARD GAME WHERE YOUR DECK IS FULL OF LIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demon Bluff</strong> combines the tension of social deduction games with the replay value of a single-player roguelike deckbuilder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to investigate a corrupted village, gather information from each character, and piece together the truth to uncover and slay every demon in hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character is represented by a card - Villager and Outcast cards will help you track them down with information and unique abilities. But be careful -  Demons and Minions have disguised themselves as Villagers and will try to mislead you. Will you be able to see through their lies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/f715d804cd3e34482f7e739ee78e3227.poster.avif?t=1773812900\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/f715d804cd3e34482f7e739ee78e3227.webm?t=1773812900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/f715d804cd3e34482f7e739ee78e3227.mp4?t=1773812900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANY MODES TO MASTER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the lies and save multiple corrupted villages in one run, with an expanding deck of randomized cards. Or, draft your own in <strong>Deckbuilding</strong> mode - then conquer a multi-part run where you\u2019ll encounter new and increasingly complex cards, upgrades, and lies as you progress. Plus - test yourself with endless mode, challenges, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/91fdd70e283a90a55fcdd3dca845805c.poster.avif?t=1773812900\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/91fdd70e283a90a55fcdd3dca845805c.webm?t=1773812900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/91fdd70e283a90a55fcdd3dca845805c.mp4?t=1773812900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND, UNLOCK, AND CUSTOMIZE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep saving villages and unlock dozens of new character cards to expand your deck or encounter in randomized runs. Then, customize them with alternate skins, card backs, and decorations you\u2019ll collect as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/b51a9155c2c610bec32f27656b9529cd.poster.avif?t=1773812900\" width=1170 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/b51a9155c2c610bec32f27656b9529cd.webm?t=1773812900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/extras/b51a9155c2c610bec32f27656b9529cd.mp4?t=1773812900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ unique character cards to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic unlocks and customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly complex mechanics and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple modes and scenarios to encounter and master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember - THE CARDS LIE.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522600?t=1773812900","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/76e73763c7e21d3baa0e1c03545e4fb6a3a7407c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773812900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/753eba1de92fbe7bff68e0a49c1e06e5b5781111/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773812900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522600/753eba1de92fbe7bff68e0a49c1e06e5b5781111/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773812900","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item